WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:07.050
Happiness, as an emotion, is one on a spectrum
of many.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:13.240
It is, of course, our favorite emotion though,
and we dedicate our entire lives trying to

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.700
isolate it.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:21.130
But even if we could control the conditions
of life to solely produce happiness, we should

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.220
not want to.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.860
Without negative emotions, we would never
know what feels positive.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:33.500
We do not want the emotion of happiness to
be permanent, because without binary contrast,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.109
there is no distinction between emotions and
therefore, there becomes none.

00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:41.600
What we need is a different kind of happiness.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:48.949
A happiness that comes from the appreciation
of the idea that we are able to feel and experience

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.469
the entire spectrum of life and emotion.

00:00:53.469 --> 00:00:59.979
We must not confuse attempting to achieve
a sense of wonder and stimulation in life

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:03.010
with attempting to achieve the emotion of
happiness.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:08.570
It is good to feel the emotion of happiness
and we should try our best to do so as much

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:15.229
as possible, but when we chase the idea that
this happiness can be a ceaseless and constant

00:01:15.229 --> 00:01:22.789
state of being, we remain in a never-ending
pursuit, attempting to blockade the ebb-and-flow

00:01:22.789 --> 00:01:24.289
of life.

00:01:24.289 --> 00:01:26.630
But of course, this is impossible.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:32.229
The flow of life is far too strong and powerful
to dam.

00:01:32.229 --> 00:01:39.690
There are too many moving parts for everything
to always work in favor of just one person…

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.820
including you.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:48.119
You must, instead, be appreciative that you
are not always happy and that life thinks

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:54.439
your worthy of experiencing the incredible
array of emotions.

00:01:54.439 --> 00:02:00.030
Things won’t always be good and things won’t
always be bad, but at least they will always

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.030
be.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:07.009
Deep down, we fear a life of complete certainty
and happiness.

00:02:07.009 --> 00:02:13.340
If our lives were free from all problems,
our only remaining problem would be not having

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.340
any.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:17.180
Our sense of purpose would dissolve.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:22.150
We would stand still in a world that is in
constant motion.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:28.290
In order to be a part of the life around us,
we must move with it and accept the flow of

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.440
ups and downs.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:34.090
You must be like a garden.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:39.450
Out of which the entire spectrum of emotions
can grow.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:45.790
As the seasons and conditions of life change,
certain plants will bloom while others will

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.180
die.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:54.960
But as the cycle rotates, your garden will
remain rich, sustainable, and full of life.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:03:02.150
Ironically, by maintaining an appreciation
for the whole spectrum of emotions, happiness

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:07.970
will appear more often in your life and you
will get what you really wanted in the first

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:08.480
place.

